Project: "Aero Launcher", an original Android launcher app in Java (XML views, AndroidX).
Rules for every task:
1. Java only. compileSdk/targetSdk 36, minSdk 24, 64-bit, AAB output. JDK 17.
2. Originality: never copy Apple's or any other app's name, icons, wallpapers, fonts or sounds. Use only original or properly licensed assets and log each in ASSET_LICENSES.md.
3. Use only normal permissions. Do NOT use QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES; use <queries> with the MAIN/LAUNCHER intent. Ask for any other permission only when the feature is used.
4. Collect no personal data. No analytics or ads without asking me first.
5. Handle edge-to-edge screens (API 36) with WindowInsets.
6. Ask before adding any library. Keep code modular, commented and smooth at 60fps.
